ast minute. They've never even met the buyer.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Sounds like someone inside the city is buying slaves on the sly and using dead drops to cover their tracks.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","avg1_162","That's what I figured. And the girl we rescued backs it up.",0,""],["show","avg3_225","a","003",0.27,-0.45,1.6,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_225","a",null,null,0.25,null,null,0.85,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_162","This morning, the Saintess summoned me. She asked me to talk you into making Elis a freedwoman, and offered to pay you out of her own pocket.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["show","avg3_229","a","004",0.73,-0.4,1.6,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_229","a",null,null,0.75,null,null,0.85,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_162","Right after I left the temple, I ran into those people. According to them, the girl appeared out of thin air on the street.",0,""],["chd",0,0,"avg3_182","b","027","question"],["say","avg3_182","Out of thin air? Filanis Island is surrounded by water, slavery is outlawed, and she had a slave collar around her neck.==W== No way she came ashore and strolled all the way to the temple without a soul noticing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["chd",1,0,"avg3_182","a","002",null],["ctl","avg3_225","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["hide","avg3_225",0.7],["ctl","avg3_229","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["hide","avg3_229",0.7],["stg",0,0.0,-50.0,1.25,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_226"],["say","avg1_162","That's the biggest question mark here. But flip it around... What if she was on the island the whole time?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","014","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Ah. I get it now.",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","020","speechless","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Someone defied Archon Olympia's decree and kept slaves at home.",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","003","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","When the girl escaped, they couldn't claim her without exposing themselves. So they framed her as the Fallen Saintess to have her silenced.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,0.5,0.0,1.0,null,"JuGong","OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_162","My thoughts exactly. And I bet the missing children saw something they shouldn't have and got snatched.",0,""],["say","avg1_162","If the culprit wanted to get rid of them quietly, their best bet would be handing the kids off to those slavers outside the island to be shipped to another city.",0,""],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,0.5,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_074"],["say","avg1_162","Which means if we catch whoever's hiding slaves on the island, we can unravel the whole network and track down those kids.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_251"],["say","avg1_162","Even if they've been sold to the farthest city on the map, I'll track them down and bring them home myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Makes sense. If we keep tabs on the ringleaders who tried to kill that girl and stake out the streets they live on, we might catch a break.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","014",null,"diantou"],["se","se_077"],["say","avg3_100","Let's get moving, then. Every day we lose puts those kids in more danger.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","0